# Nail — English UI strings: live search and the search field's error
# indicator (R1, ADR 0219).
#
# Message ids start with the prefixes listed in
# ui/src/features/search/messages.ts. The search field's older texts
# (search-bar-*, search-hint-*, search-error-*) are in app.ftl.

# Note under a query mistake: the list still shows the last valid search.
search-live-kept = The list still shows the results for “{ $query }”.
# Note under a query mistake when no search is active.
search-live-not-run = Fix the query to search.
